{
  "kHelpPages": [
    "<font color='#7fa7ff'><b>INVISANT</b></font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invis</font><font color='#ffb900'>ible assail</font><font color='#7fa7ff'>ant</font><font color='#ffb900'>.</font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><font color='#ffb900'> cannot hear your</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>footsteps. Kill all </font><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><font color='#ffb900'> to</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>win. Track living </font><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>through walls. No fall damage.</font>",
    "<font color='#7fa7ff'><b>INVISANT</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Knife-only. </font><font color='#93c47d'>{KNIFE_CONE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> deg cone.</font><br><font color='#93c47d'>{KNIFE_RANGE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> units of reach.</font><br><font color='#93c47d'>{KNIFE_DAMAGE_MIN}-{KNIFE_DAMAGE_MAX}</font><font color='#ffb900'> damage per hit.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>No backstab bonus. Attacks at</font><br><font color='#93c47d'>{KNIFE_SPEED}%</font><font color='#ffb900'> of normal speed.</font>",
    "<font color='#7fa7ff'><b>INVISANT</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>After </font><font color='#93c47d'>{STARVATION_ROUND_DELAY}s</font><font color='#ffb900'> of live play, </font><font color='#93c47d'>{STARVATION_COMBAT_DELAY}s</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>without dealing or taking</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>damage starts </font><font color='#b9a176'>Starvation</font><font color='#ffb900'>.</font><br><font color='#93c47d'>{STARVATION_DAMAGE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> HP / </font><font color='#93c47d'>{STARVATION_INTERVAL}s</font><font color='#ffb900'>; after </font><font color='#93c47d'>{STARVATION_ACCELERATION_DELAY}s</font><font color='#ffb900'>:</font><br><font color='#93c47d'>{STARVATION_ACCELERATED_DAMAGE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> HP / </font><font color='#93c47d'>{STARVATION_ACCELERATED_INTERVAL}s</font><font color='#ffb900'> until combat.</font>",
    "<font color='#e07a6a'><b>ARMITIVE</b></font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Arm</font><font color='#ffb900'>ed fug</font><font color='#e07a6a'>itive</font><font color='#ffb900'>. Find the</font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> with firearms, blood,</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>and contact. Buy weapons</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>permitted by this server.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Win if any survive the timer.</font>",
    "<font color='#e07a6a'><b>ARMITIVE</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Headshot damage to </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> is</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>halved and capped at </font><font color='#93c47d'>90</font><font color='#ffb900'>. One</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>headshot cannot kill a</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>full-health </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'>.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Timer ends: </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> {TIMEOUT_RESULT}</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>ROUND END</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>The round result is final.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Kills after round end give no</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>XP, rank, or </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> priority.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Keep earned priority and wait</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>for the next round.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>ROTATION</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Roles rotate each round. A</font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><font color='#ffb900'> who kills an </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>gets priority to become </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>next round.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>ROTATION</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Otherwise, the longest-waiting</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>eligible player becomes</font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'>. Suicide forfeits</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>next-round eligibility.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>RANKINGS</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Type </font><font color='#b9a176'>rank</font><font color='#ffb900'> in chat to see your</font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> and </font><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><font color='#ffb900'> ranks.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Kills and assists raise ratings;</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>deaths lower them. More combat</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>makes your record count more.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>PROGRESSION</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Kills, qualifying damage</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>assists, and completed-round</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>wins grant separate </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> and</font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><font color='#ffb900'> XP.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>PROGRESSION</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>As </font><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><font color='#ffb900'>, knife kills earn </font><font color='#93c47d'>{KNIFE_XP}%</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>kill XP; pistol kills, </font><font color='#93c47d'>{PISTOL_XP}%</font><font color='#ffb900'>.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Levels grant upgrade points. In</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>chat, type </font><font color='#b9a176'>upgrade</font><font color='#ffb900'> for effects;</font><br><font color='#b9a176'>menu</font><font color='#ffb900'> to spend or reset points.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>KILL STREAKS</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>In 2v2+ rounds, the first enemy</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>kill earns </font><font color='#b9a176'>First Blood</font><font color='#ffb900'>: </font><font color='#93c47d'>125%</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>kill XP. Your second kill within</font><br><font color='#93c47d'>10s</font><font color='#ffb900'> of the last earns </font><font color='#93c47d'>120%</font><font color='#ffb900'>.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>KILL STREAKS</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Each later kill within </font><font color='#93c47d'>10s</font><font color='#ffb900'> of</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>your last adds </font><font color='#93c47d'>10%</font><font color='#ffb900'> kill XP, up</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>to </font><font color='#93c47d'>200%</font><font color='#ffb900'> on your tenth kill. Only</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>you hear the sounds.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Type </font><font color='#b9a176'>help</font><font color='#ffb900'> to reopen this panel.</font>"
  ],
  "kCheatPages": [
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>ESP AND WALLHACKS</b></font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> are not made</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>transparent. The server does not</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>send </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> players, or their</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>weapon and movement sounds, to</font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><font color='#ffb900'> computers.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>ESP AND WALLHACKS</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>ESP and wallhacks can only show</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>data a computer receives. With</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>no </font><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'> player data, they</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>cannot reveal or track an</font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Invisant</font><font color='#ffb900'>.</font>",
    "<font color='#93c47d'><b>ESP AND WALLHACKS</b></font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Armitive</font><font color='#ffb900'> still see blood and</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>bullet impacts, and hear damage</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>sounds. </font><font color='#d6b86a'>Report suspicious</font><br><font color='#d6b86a'>behavior to an administrator.</font>"
  ],
  "kKnownBugPages": [
    "<font color='#78b9ff'><b>INVISANT AUDIO</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>You still hear your footsteps,</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>jumps and landings. CS2 plays</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>these locally. The server filters</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>them before sending to Armitive.</font>",
    "<font color='#ff7169'><b>DEXTERITY ANIMATIONS</b></font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Reload and weapon switch</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>animations may look unchanged.</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Dexterity still makes ammo ready</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>and lets you fire sooner.</font>"
  ],
  "kUpgradePages": [
    "<font color='#ffb900'>Normal stages unlock at role</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>levels </font><font color='#93c47d'>{N1}</font><font color='#ffb900'>, </font><font color='#93c47d'>{N2}</font><font color='#ffb900'>, </font><font color='#93c47d'>{N3}</font><font color='#ffb900'>, </font><font color='#93c47d'>{N4}</font><font color='#ffb900'> and </font><font color='#93c47d'>{N5}</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Ultimate stages unlock at role</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>levels </font><font color='#93c47d'>{U1}</font><font color='#ffb900'>, </font><font color='#93c47d'>{U2}</font><font color='#ffb900'>, </font><font color='#93c47d'>{U3}</font><font color='#ffb900'>, </font><font color='#93c47d'>{U4}</font><font color='#ffb900'> and </font><font color='#93c47d'>{U5}</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>Type </font><font color='#b9a176'>menu</font><font color='#ffb900'> to spend/reset points</font>",
    "<font color='#e07a6a'><b>ARMITIVE</b></font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Fortitude</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{FORTITUDE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> maximum</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>health per stage</font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Recovery</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Restore </font><font color='#93c47d'>{RECOVERY}</font><font color='#ffb900'> health</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>per stage every </font><font color='#93c47d'>{RECOVERY_INTERVAL}</font><font color='#ffb900'> seconds</font>",
    "<font color='#e07a6a'><b>ARMITIVE</b></font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Overload</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{OVERLOAD}%</font><font color='#ffb900'> extra</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>magazine capacity per stage</font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Stockpile</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{STOCKPILE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> extra</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>reserve ammo clip per stage</font>",
    "<font color='#e07a6a'><b>ARMITIVE</b></font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Barrage</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{BARRAGE}%</font><font color='#ffb900'> faster</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>weapon fire rate per stage</font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Control</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{CONTROL}%</font><font color='#ffb900'> less recoil</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>and bullet spread per stage</font>",
    "<font color='#e07a6a'><b>ARMITIVE</b></font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Dexterity</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{DEXTERITY}%</font><font color='#ffb900'> faster</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>weapon switch and reload</font><br><font color='#e07a6a'>Ultimate: Ward</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Press </font><font color='#93c47d'>E</font><font color='#ffb900'> for</font><br><font color='#93c47d'>{WARD_BASE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> seconds of immunity at </font><font color='#93c47d'>1</font><font color='#ffb900'>/</font><font color='#93c47d'>5</font><font color='#ffb900'>,</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>plus </font><font color='#93c47d'>{WARD_STEP}</font><font color='#ffb900'> seconds per stage</font>",
    "<font color='#7fa7ff'><b>INVISANT</b></font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Lightweight</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{LIGHTWEIGHT}%</font><font color='#ffb900'> less</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>gravity per stage</font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Momentum</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{MOMENTUM}%</font><font color='#ffb900'> faster</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>run speed per stage</font>",
    "<font color='#7fa7ff'><b>INVISANT</b></font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Resilience</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{RESILIENCE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> armor</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>per stage and helmet at </font><font color='#ffb900'>{HELMET_STAGE}/5</font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Reforging</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{REFORGING}</font><font color='#ffb900'> armor per</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>stage every </font><font color='#93c47d'>{REFORGING_INTERVAL}</font><font color='#ffb900'> seconds</font>",
    "<font color='#7fa7ff'><b>INVISANT</b></font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Vampirism</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{VAMPIRISM}</font><font color='#ffb900'> health per</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>stage when dealing damage</font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Bloodlust</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{BLOODLUST}</font><font color='#ffb900'> health per</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>stage when killing an enemy</font>",
    "<font color='#7fa7ff'><b>INVISANT</b></font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Mobility</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Gain </font><font color='#93c47d'>{MOBILITY}%</font><font color='#ffb900'> faster</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>crouching speed per stage</font><br><font color='#7fa7ff'>Ultimate: Surge</font><font color='#ffb900'> - Press </font><font color='#93c47d'>E</font><font color='#ffb900'> for a</font><br><font color='#93c47d'>{SURGE_BASE}</font><font color='#ffb900'> unit speed boost at </font><font color='#93c47d'>1</font><font color='#ffb900'>/</font><font color='#93c47d'>5</font><font color='#ffb900'>,</font><br><font color='#ffb900'>increased by </font><font color='#93c47d'>{SURGE_STEP}</font><font color='#ffb900'> per stage</font>"
  ]
}
